ind, wie Sie uns kontaktieren können und wie wir personenbezogene Daten verarbeiten. Bitte geben Sie Ihre Einwilligungs-ID und das Datum an, wenn Sie uns bezüglich Ihrer Einwilligung kontaktieren. Meine persönlichen Daten nicht verkaufen oder weitergeben Ablehnen Auswahl erlauben Anpassen Alle zulassen Jobs Alle Jobs anzeigen Events Alle Veranstaltungen anzeigen Student Services Arbeitgeberprofile Corporate Services LNOC Für Studierende Für Arbeitgeber LNOC Manual - Infos für Arbeitgeber JobHub Für Studierende Für Arbeitgeber Login DE Deutsch English Intern - Deal Advisory - Valuation & Financial Modeling KPMG AG 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Beschreibung Facebook Twitter LinkedIn Intern - Deal Advisory - Valuation & Financial Modeling Are you looking to gain hands-on experience in an international corporate finance environment? Our Valuation & Financial Modelling team assists clients in creating, growing and preserving value in connection with M&A, joint ventures, post-merger integrations, restructurings and disputes. Are you looking to gain hands-on experience in an international corporate finance environment? Our Valuation & Financial Modelling team assists clients in creating, growing and preserving value in connection with M&A, joint ventures, post-merger integrations, restructurings and disputes. Your contribution to KPMG Support the team in performing company, intangible asset, and business valuations as well as financial and market analyses Assist with financial modelling, market research, capital market analyses, and cost of capital assessments Contribute to valuation engagements related to M&A transactions, fairness opinions, accounting matters, tax planning, and dispute resolution Help analyze and value financial instruments, including options, derivatives, and structured products, under the guidance of experienced professionals Prepare research, presentations, valuation reports, and client deliverables for a wide range of projects Collaborate with multidisciplinary teams, including transaction services, restructuring, accounting, tax, and legal specialists Gain exposure to projects for both large international corporations and mid-market companies in a dynamic and international environment Support business development activities, including proposal preparation, market analyses, and other marketing initiatives This is what makes you successful You are currently pursuing a Bachelor's or Master's degree in Finance, Accounting, Economics, Business Administration, or a related field with a strong academic performance You bring a strong interest in corporate valuation, financial modelling, M&A, and capital markets You have initial experience with financial analysis and modelling through coursework, internships, student projects, or extracurricular activities You bring an analytical mindset with the ability to work with financial data and assess complex business situations You are proficient in Microsoft Excel and PowerPoint You possess strong communication and teamwork skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively in an international and multidisciplinary environment You have a high level of curiosity, initiative, and attention to detail, combined with a willingness to learn and take on new challenges You are fluent in German and English Questions? We are here for you Location Zurich Badenerstrasse 172 8036 Zurich Angelina Kothe Campus Recruiting Specialist Stelle anzeigen Publikationsdatum 02.09.2026 Arbeitspensum (%) 100% Branche Steuer- / Wirtschaftsprüfung Funktionsbereich Beratung, Planung & Strategie Stellenantritt Nach Vereinbarung Arbeitsort Badenerstrasse 172 8004 Zürich Schweiz Kontaktinformationen Frau Angelina Kothe Weitere Jobs KPMG AG Praktikum - Audit Insurance KPMG AG 27.08.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen KPMG AG Consultant / Senior Consultant - SAP Transformation KPMG AG 24.08.2026 100% Feststelle - Berufserfahrene Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen KPMG AG Consultant - Legal, Regulation & Compliance Financial Services 80-100% KPMG AG 19.08.2026 100% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen KPMG AG Graduate - Audit Banking & Asset Management KPMG AG 18.08.2026 100% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen KPMG AG Consultant - Deal Advisory - Valuation & Financial Modelling KPMG AG 07.08.2026 100% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen KPMG AG Graduate Program - International Corporate Tax Consulting KPMG AG 01.08.2026 100% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Unsere Partner Unser Partner in Stilfragen Unser Partner für Karrierethemen Kontakt UZH Universität Zürich Career Services der Universität Zürich Schönberggasse 15 8001 Zürich info@careerservices.uzh.ch Studierende: +41 44 634 59 80 Arbeitgeber: +41 44 634 21 62 Nützliche Links FAQ Datenschutzerklärung AGB Über uns Doppelt profitieren mit nur einem Profil! Mit deinem uzhcareer-Login hast du auch Zugriff auf uzhstudy.ch. Hier gehts zu uzhstudy.ch Social Media"
