ind, wie Sie uns kontaktieren können und wie wir personenbezogene Daten verarbeiten. Bitte geben Sie Ihre Einwilligungs-ID und das Datum an, wenn Sie uns bezüglich Ihrer Einwilligung kontaktieren. Meine persönlichen Daten nicht verkaufen oder weitergeben Ablehnen Auswahl erlauben Anpassen Alle zulassen Jobs Alle Jobs anzeigen Events Alle Veranstaltungen anzeigen Student Services Arbeitgeberprofile Corporate Services LNOC Für Studierende Für Arbeitgeber LNOC Manual - Infos für Arbeitgeber JobHub Für Studierende Für Arbeitgeber Login DE Deutsch English Business Development Family Office Trainee Parkview AG 40% Traineestelle Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Beschreibung Facebook Twitter LinkedIn Family Office Trainee The Role You will work closely with the Head of Business Development and contribute from day one to acquiring new clients and supporting an existing client base. The traineeship also includes structured academic exposure to the family office sector, combining practical experience with a solid theoretical foundation. What's In It for You Developing new business is one of the most demanding disciplines in finance. Creativity, lateral thinking, and a willingness to go the extra mile are the qualities that set successful professionals apart throughout their careers in financial services. This traineeship offers a rare, hands-on opportunity to see from the inside how these critical activities are planned strategically and executed day to day. What You'll Need to Succeed - Bachelor's degree in Banking and Finance, Business Administration, or Business and Economics - Currently pursuing a Master's degree - Well-organized, with an open and engaging personality - Able to work independently, with strong analytical skills and a genuine interest in financial markets - Driven and motivated, comfortable thinking across multiple dimensions and finding solutions where none seem obvious - Comfortable working in a global team spanning multiple locations - Client-focused, always willing to go the extra mile to find the right solution - Flexible, with a strong willingness to learn on the job - You will need strong working skills in PowerPoint and Excel, alongside the analytical ability to translate complex information into clear, compelling messages - Next to German, strong English required; Spanish or Portuguese is a plus but not essential of 0 100% Rotate Clockwise Rotate Counterclockwise Switch Orientation First Page Last Page Reset Zoom Print Document Download Document View Metadata Draw Stelle anzeigen Publikationsdatum 01.09.2026 Arbeitspensum (%) 40% Branche Banken / Finanzinstitute Funktionsbereich Beratung, Planung & Strategie Stellenantritt 01.10.2026 Gehalt CHF 30,00 / Stunde Arbeitsort Gutenbergstrasse 9 8002 Zürich Schweiz Kontaktinformationen Herr Sebastian Derungs +41 44 2834384 E-Mail Gutenbergstrasse 9 1661 8002 Zürich Unsere Partner Unser Partner in Stilfragen Unser Partner für Karrierethemen Kontakt UZH Universität Zürich Career Services der Universität Zürich Schönberggasse 15 8001 Zürich info@careerservices.uzh.ch Studierende: +41 44 634 59 80 Arbeitgeber: +41 44 634 21 62 Nützliche Links FAQ Datenschutzerklärung AGB Über uns Doppelt profitieren mit nur einem Profil! Mit deinem uzhcareer-Login hast du auch Zugriff auf uzhstudy.ch. Hier gehts zu uzhstudy.ch Social Media"
