    "https://uzhcareer.ch/de/jobs/detail/?id=5b10ff7e-aab1-f111-9b5e-d733d90f01ed&slug=junior-administrative-assistant-zug-80-100": {
      "title": "JUNIOR ADMINISTRATIVE ASSISTANT (Zug 80-100%)",
      "description": "Detail Jobs Alle Jobs anzeigen Events Alle Veranstaltungen anzeigen Student Services Arbeitgeberprofile Corporate Services LNOC Für Studierende Für Arbeitgeber LNOC Manual - Infos für Arbeitgeber JobHub Für Studierende Für Arbeitgeber Login DE Deutsch English JUNIOR ADMINISTRATIVE ASSISTANT (Zug 80-100%) Copernicus Wealth Management SA 80% Teilzeitstelle Schweiz Beschreibung Facebook Twitter LinkedIn JUNIOR ADMINISTRATIVE ASSISTANT (Zug 80-100%) Fluent Italian and German About us We are a small Swiss entrepreneurial organization operating discreetly and confidentially in wealth management and investments. We work in a dynamic, international, and constantly evolving environment, with a strong focus on professionalism, reliability, and confidentiality. To strengthen our team, we are seeking a Junior Administrative Assistant who can carry out a broad range of administrative, financial, and organizational tasks with accuracy, discretion, and initiative. Key responsibilities Manage general administration and provide operational support for the office’s day-to-day activities. Collect, verify, record, and file invoices, receipts, and accounting documentation. Prepare and execute payments through electronic banking systems. Enter and update data in company systems. Organize and maintain electronic and paper filing systems. Draft, process, and route commercial and administrative correspondence. Liaise with banks, fiduciary companies, insurance providers, administrative authorities, and other external stakeholders. Prepare reports, statistics, periodic statements, and a variety of administrative documents. Support accounting and administrative control processes. Handle HR-related administrative matters and prepare data for payroll processing. Monitor deadlines, administrative procedures, and recurring obligations. Provide organizational support for business trips, appointments, and management’s operational activities. Collaborate cross-functionally with external consultants and professional partners. Your profile Commercial or administrative education/training. 1 or 2 years of experience in a similar role is a plus. Basic accounting skills Excellent spoken and written Italian and German; English would be an advantage. Strong command of the main IT tools and Microsoft Office applications. Experience in administrative, document, and financial management. A high level of independence and the ability to set priorities effectively. Accuracy, reliability, and a strong sense of responsibility. A dynamic, pragmatic, and solution-oriented approach. The highest level of discretion and the ability to handle confidential information. Willingness to travel occasionally within Switzerland. What we offer The opportunity to join a small ambitious team. A professional environment built on trust, autonomy, and responsibility. A trusted role with a high level of operational involvement. The chance to actively contribute to the development and efficiency of our administrative activities. Competitive employment conditions aligned with the selected candidate’s experience and skills. Place of work: Zug Occupational rate: Part-time 80-100% Start date: as soon as possible In case of interest, please send your full application dossier (CV, diplomas and certificate, work certificate, etc) to applications@groupcopernicus.com All applications will be handled with the utmost confidentiality. Publikationsdatum 16.09.2026 Arbeitspensum (%) 80% Branche Banken / Finanzinstitute Funktionsbereich Administration, HR & Organisation Beratung, Planung & Strategie Stellenantritt Per sofort Arbeitsort Copernicus Wealth Management AG 8001 Zürich Schweiz Kontaktinformationen Herr Nele Sturbois 0586541725 E-Mail Via al Forte 1 6900 Lugano Unsere Partner Unser Partner in Stilfragen Unser Partner für Karrierethemen Kontakt UZH Universität Zürich Career Services der Universität Zürich Schönberggasse 15 8001 Zürich info@careerservices.uzh.ch Studierende: +41 44 634 59 80 Arbeitgeber: +41 44 634 21 62 Nützliche Links FAQ Datenschutzerklärung AGB Über uns Doppelt profitieren mit nur einem Profil! Mit deinem uzhcareer-Login hast du auch Zugriff auf uzhstudy.ch. Hier gehts zu uzhstudy.ch Social Media"
    },
