ind, wie Sie uns kontaktieren können und wie wir personenbezogene Daten verarbeiten. Bitte geben Sie Ihre Einwilligungs-ID und das Datum an, wenn Sie uns bezüglich Ihrer Einwilligung kontaktieren. Meine persönlichen Daten nicht verkaufen oder weitergeben Ablehnen Auswahl erlauben Anpassen Alle zulassen Jobs Alle Jobs anzeigen Events Alle Veranstaltungen anzeigen Unsere Services Beratungen Arbeitgeberprofile Corporate Services LNOC Für Studierende Für Arbeitgeber LNOC Manual - Infos für Arbeitgeber JobHub Für Studierende Für Arbeitgeber Login DE Deutsch English Investor & Family Relations Internship (Private Equity) GENTIS Partners 100% Praktikum Schweiz Beschreibung Facebook Twitter LinkedIn of 2 100% Rotate Clockwise Rotate Counterclockwise Switch Orientation First Page Last Page Reset Zoom Print Document Download Document View Metadata Draw PRIVATE & CONF I DENTIAL G E N T I S P A R T N E R S Position Specification — Private & Confidential Investor & Famil y Relations Intern Position Investor & Famil y Relations Intern (Investor Relations & Fundraising) Location Zug /Zurich Working with The founding partners Hiring Timeline Immediate , for 3 - 6 months, in - person in our office in Zug Fund focus Fund I — €20 – 60m equity, €5 – 20 m EBITDA, European mid - market THE FIRM GENTIS Partners is a purpose - built private capital platform for families, family offices, and like - minded investors. The firm focuses on control and co - control investments in the European mid - market, partnering with founders and management teams to support the next phase of their growth. We are based in Zug/Switzerland with offices in London as well as Luxembourg. Founded in 2026 by experienced investors — with backgrounds from BlackRock, Apollo, Barclays and BCG — and backed by more than twenty - fi ve prominent global families to date, GENTIS combines blue - chip private equity discipline with the flexibility, network and long - term perspective of family capital . The family network in turn is a source of differentiation in proprietary deal flow, operating expertise and a partnership - led approach that resonates with family - and founder - owned businesses . THE ROLE This full - time, on - site internship covers investor communications, investor materials, meeting preparation and investor records. The work reaches principals of substantial family enterprises directly, so accuracy, judgement and discretion matter throughout . It offers early and direct exposure to fundraising and investor relationships — a sound foundation for a career in investor relations, private equity, family offices, and related fields. RESPONSIBILITIES – Investor communications — preparing and proofreading investor letters, reporting correspondence and ad - hoc investor requests. – Investor materials — presentations, case studies, one - pagers and data - room content in GENTIS house style. – Meetings and events — briefing notes and preparation packs; support for investor meetings and events in Zug. – Investor records — maintaining contact records, meeting logs and commitments in the firm’s CRM. – Prospective investor s — research and profiles of family offices and entrepreneurial families, and the background material behind an approach. – Origination support — proposing routes to reach prospective investors and preparing the approach itself. – Family & investor events — organizing and coordinating events for GENTIS's entrepreneurial families, including conception, invitations, logistics, and follow - up. Publikationsdatum 21.09.2026 Arbeitspensum (%) 100% Branche Banken / Finanzinstitute Funktionsbereich Verkauf & Kundendienst Stellenantritt Per sofort Arbeitsort Baarerstrasse 52 6300 Zug Schweiz Kontaktinformationen Frau Evelina Dimitriadi +447543147220 E-Mail Baarerstrasse 52 6300 Zug Unsere Partner Unser Partner in Stilfragen Unser Partner für Karrierethemen Kontakt UZH Universität Zürich Career Services der Universität Zürich Schönberggasse 15 8001 Zürich info@careerservices.uzh.ch Studierende: +41 44 634 59 80 Arbeitgeber: +41 44 634 21 62 Nützliche Links FAQ Datenschutzerklärung AGB Über uns Doppelt profitieren mit nur einem Profil! Mit deinem uzhcareer-Login hast du auch Zugriff auf uzhstudy.ch. Hier gehts zu uzhstudy.ch Social Media"
