ind, wie Sie uns kontaktieren können und wie wir personenbezogene Daten verarbeiten. Bitte geben Sie Ihre Einwilligungs-ID und das Datum an, wenn Sie uns bezüglich Ihrer Einwilligung kontaktieren. Meine persönlichen Daten nicht verkaufen oder weitergeben Ablehnen Auswahl erlauben Anpassen Alle zulassen Jobs Alle Jobs anzeigen Events Alle Veranstaltungen anzeigen Unsere Services Beratungen Arbeitgeberprofile Corporate Services LNOC Für Studierende Für Arbeitgeber LNOC Manual - Infos für Arbeitgeber JobHub Für Studierende Für Arbeitgeber Login DE Deutsch English Internship 2027 | Public Equities Active Ownership Spectrum Entrepreneurial Ownership 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Beschreibung Facebook Twitter LinkedIn We offer 3+ month internships throughout 2027 with flexible start dates. Please apply by submitting your CV, cover letter and university transcripts with your application to resumes@spectrum-eo.com. Established in 2022, Spectrum Entrepreneurial Ownership (SEO) is an active ownership fund that manages long-term stable capital from several family offices, pension funds and institutional investors. SEO combines a private equity due diligence approach with a long-term owner mindset to public equity markets. We invest in high-quality businesses with broad and rich value improvement potential and act as an engaged and reliable partner to management, supporting value creation for all stakeholders through constructive hands-on engagement. SEO runs a concentrated portfolio (6-8 positions) of significant minority positions in listed companies. The fund is being managed by an experienced team with broad operational and boardroom experience, which has been implementing this strategy for more than a decade. of 0 100% Rotate Clockwise Rotate Counterclockwise Switch Orientation First Page Last Page Reset Zoom Print Document Download Document View Metadata Draw Stelle anzeigen Publikationsdatum 22.09.2026 Arbeitspensum (%) 100% Branche Unternehmens- / Strat